<title>USA: First Commerce to redeem preferred stock.</title>
<headline>First Commerce to redeem preferred stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Commerce Corp said Monday it will redeem its 7.25% cumulative convertible preferred stock, Series 1992, on January 2, 1997, for $25.00 per share plus $.453125 in accrued dividends.</p>
<p>The preferred stock is also convertible into 1.1646 shares of First Commerce common stock.</p>
<p>Preferred stock holders who wish to convert must do so on or before December 23, 1996, the firm said.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
